{
  "description": "A 包，四个入口（含 0 参入口 answer）（score 为 default），--entry 选择与缺省；模块内没有名为 main 的函数（P0 结果 §3 / 修订 A5 E737）。ratio(7) 产出 Double，ratio(0) 两侧都是求值错误。另含 USAGE 用例。 probes 含一条期望 EVAL_ERROR 的探针（ratio(0)）。命令行语法用例（README「命令行」）：重复选项、--opt=value、选项在位置参数之前、--timeout 语法、未知子命令、缺参数、--pubkey 与 --jwks 同时给出。",
  "package": "a-multi-entry",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "default-entry",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "a-multi-entry",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"x\":7}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":\"3d667550cb0af5862369347cdedc4c993575b61d6f66479e5cdefd9039981334\",\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":\"score\",\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":true,\"value\":70}\n",
      "expectedExit": 0,
      "code": null
    },
    {
      "name": "entry-label",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "a-multi-entry",
        "--entry",
        "label",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"x\":7}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":\"3d667550cb0af5862369347cdedc4c993575b61d6f66479e5cdefd9039981334\",\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":\"label\",\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":true,\"value\":\"high\"}\n",
      "expectedExit": 0,
      "code": null
    },
